+INTERNAL REVIEW FORM AND SCORES (NOT AN OFFICIAL ARR FORM)
+Use review_form with summary, strengths, weaknesses, and questions.
+The summary is neutral and author-recognizable; strengths and weaknesses
+are evidence-tied, and each weakness maps to an ISSUE-ID. Questions
