+Use internal_scores with soundness, presentation, contribution, overall,
+and confidence. All are internal integer 1-5 scales, not official ARR
+ratings or predictions of presentation tier. Quality dimensions:
+1 poor, 2 weak, 3 mixed, 4 strong, 5 excellent. Overall: 1 not ready,
+2 substantial revision, 3 borderline, 4 competitive, 5 compelling.
+Confidence: 1 low, 2 limited, 3 moderate, 4 high, 5 very high.
+Each score requires an evidence-based justification. overall_recommendation
+is an internal editorial judgment, not a venue decision. Leave official
+ARR scales unverified unless separately supplied and verified; never
